Regulatory and administration strategy
The administration=E2=80=99s healthcare agenda is becoming clearer across fou=
r areas:
Program integrity
CMS is emphasizing faster fraud intervention, broader recoupment authority an=
d stronger provider-enrollment enforcement. A July Medicare proposal would al=
low CMS to recover payments back to the date of noncompliance across a broade=
r range of provider revocations.
Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services
Technology consequence:
